  "customHelp": "=== TEKURANT (formerly Yosemite) - Core Rules V5.01 === SETUP: load a starter deck (Enhanced Knights or Savanna Pride). Your 7 Adaptations start FACE DOWN in the Adaptation Deck pile (bottom-left), separate from your 50-card main deck. Set your Resistance card's counter 1 to 5. Arena doesn't enforce rules - you run the turn. DAWN: remove unspent Utility; Resistance drifts 1 toward 5; draw 1 (first player skips on turn 1); play the top Adaptation (free ones land in Adaptations, costed ones you move to hand); reset every Adaptation's Energy counter, both players'; untap; play Creatures/Evolutions. MAIN: one Creature at a time, each MUST feed - Home or Away. Harvester: eat Energy = Size from Adaptations (below 0 = Overgrazing: opponent +1 Dominance per point). Reaper: eat Harvester Population, each worth that Harvester's Size. Gain Dominance = food eaten (max Size). Not fully fed = destroyed immediately. AWAY: invasion check = defender's Resistance - your Invade = Population lost. Harvesters need 1+ Pop left; Reapers need Invade >= Resistance. New Creatures can't go Away without Rush. Defender may Contest with 1 Reaper (or Guardian): higher Size + mods wins; invader losing = starves. UTILITY: emptying one of your Adaptations on your turn = +1 Utility. Spend on Tactics/Events/Gear/Evolutions/costed Adaptations; it lasts until your next Dawn. DUSK: Dusk abilities; each surviving Harvester +1 Population; 4+ Energy left in your Adaptations = +1 Stagnation. No Creatures/Evolutions at Dusk. COUNTERS (bottom strip, in order): Dominance | Utility | Stagnation. WIN at 40 Dominance. LOSE on your 4th Stagnation. RESISTANCE = counter 1 on your pinned Resistance card (top-right): set it to 5 at the start. CARD COUNTERS: Creatures - counter 1 = Population (set to 1 when played; Reapers have none), counter 2 = Rank. Adaptations - counter 1 = Energy left (reset to printed Energy at EVERY Dawn). TAP a Creature once it has made its feeding attempt; TAP an Adaptation when you empty it, then add +1 Utility. Tokens: S = Scorch (on an Adaptation, -1 Energy at next refresh), Z = Hibernating. Away: drag an invader to your Away zone. Fully fed invaders return Home; the rest starve (to Graveyard). Flip the Turn Order card for keywords and the Contest rule.",
